===Etymology===
From {{etyl|de|ru}} {{term|Sankt|lang=de}} {{term|Peter|lang=de}}{{term|Burg|burg|Saint Peter's City|lang=de}}, referring to {{w|Saint Peter}} the [[Apostle]] and alluding to its founder [[tsar|Tsar]] {{w|Peter the Great}}.

